--_000_56A6E5837929BA449B44A10BBBCFC6839D8BFABENPFEXH01NPFloca_
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="us-ascii"

Dear All

A massive reminder to all Sgts/Seniors;

Please remove the tendency of throwing juveniles in the cell as a form of "punishment". That should be a measure of last resort. THE COURT WILL PUNISH US and they have already. Therefore, please ensure you read and familiarize yourselves with the Watch House Management Standing Order again, if you haven't please do so, it's attached (but do not disseminate it outside of NPF). The information is all in there to help you. Unfortunately, some Defence lawyers had a field day in court exposing gaps in our juvenile management, so we need to start covering ourselves now or be exposed again.


You will also need to fill in the Watch House Record book, if it's not available please make all recordings on your notebooks, there are notebooks in Logistics for every frontliner. The information you record will be used as evidence in court to show how we dealt with the juvenile.

Kind regards
Peter



--_000_56A6E5837929BA449B44A10BBBCFC6839D8BFABENPFEXH01NPFloca_
